{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "self_join_syms_unknown_symbol",
    "description": "INVALID: a `join` clause's `syms` names something that is not a range symbol of the node (CONFORMANCE_SPEC.md §5.5.8).\n\n`syms` is the author's answer to the one question a pair of column names cannot settle -- which range symbol each side is read at -- so both entries MUST be keys of this aggregate's `ranges`. Here the right entry is `zzz`, which the node does not bind. Left unchecked, the right key would resolve to no symbol at all, and §5.3's degenerate-positional rule would then silently DROP the pair: an ungated full product, reported as a number rather than as a failure.\n\nThe defect is decidable STATICALLY from this ONE document -- the node's `ranges`, the document `index_sets`, the declared variable shapes and the clause itself are all here; no evaluation, no solver, no runtime data, no other file. `validate()` MUST reject it, in every binding, which is why it is pinned as a STRUCTURAL finding in tests/invalid/expected_errors.json rather than left to whichever pass a given implementation happens to run. The document is SCHEMA-VALID: the schema cannot express \"this key's axis is drawn by more than one range\".",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "aggregate",
      "join",
      "self-join",
      "invalid",
      "build-time",
      "syms"
    ]
  },
  "index_sets": {
    "rows": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 5
    }
  },
  "models": {
    "SymsUnknownSymbol": {
      "variables": {
        "row_id": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "shape": [
            "rows"
          ],
          "description": "The relation's key column."
        },
        "row_prior": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "shape": [
            "rows"
          ],
          "description": "A shifted copy of `row_id` -- an ordinary 1-D data column over the SAME index set, which is what makes the clause a self-join."
        },
        "count": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Counts the admitted pairs. Never reached: the document is rejected."
        }
